      "content": "Remove the bolts (371C), the end cover (109A), and the gasket (360C)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1258",
      "reading_order": 1458,
      "section": "Disassemble the power end ( XLT-i and i17 with duplex bearings)",
      "bbox": {
