        "t": 581.6777099999999,
        "r": 558.3545700000004,
        "b": 558.4377099999999
      },
      "content": "If  necessary, remove the outboard labyrinth oil seal (332A) from the end cover (109A) and remove the O-rings (497F and 497G)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1259",
